o. Do not enter private information.</p><form id=\"brief\"><label for=\"name\">Project name</label><input id=\"name\" required minlength=\"3\" maxlength=\"80\" placeholder=\"Community garden\"><label for=\"kind\">Project type</label><select id=\"kind\"><option>Web application</option><option>Analytics dashboard</option><option>Mobile experience</option></select><label for=\"goal\">What should it solve?</label><textarea id=\"goal\" required minlength=\"10\" maxlength=\"300\" placeholder=\"Help neighbours coordinate their garden.\"></textarea><button class=\"primary\">Save brief</button><button type=\"reset\">Reset</button><output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\"></output></form></div><script>const form=document.querySelector('#brief');form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();document.querySelector('#result').textContent='Brief saved in this preview: '+document.querySelector('#name').value+'. No data was sent.'});form.addEventListener('reset',()=>{document.querySelector('#result').textContent=''})</script></body></html>","README.md":"# Project brief form\n\nVersion: 1.0.0\nOriginal getLancer curated recipe. Licence: MIT.\n\n## Setup\nOpen index.html in a modern browser. No packages, installation, API keys or external assets are required. Optional local server: python3 -m http.server 8000.\n\n## Try\nSubmit an empty form, complete a sample brief, then reset it.\n\n## Files\nindex.html contains the working HTML, CSS and JavaScript. LICENSE contains redistribution terms. README.md contains this setup guide.\n\n## Accessibility\nKeyboard controls, visible focus, 44px targets and reduced-motion support. Test your own modifications before release.\n\n## Dependencies\nNone. HTML/CSS and browser JavaScript only. No external fonts or images.\n\n## Data and limits\nSynthetic data held in preview memory. No account service, production credentials, tracking or network requests.\n","LICENSE":"MIT License\n\nCopyright (c) 2026 getLancer contributors\n\nPermission is 