rtant}}</style></head><body><div class=\"panel\" style=\"max-width:420px;margin:auto\"><span class=\"pill\">Studio / Demo account</span><h1 style=\"margin-top:20px\">Welcome back.</h1><p class=\"muted\">Use member@example.test and demo-only. Never use a real password.</p><form id=\"login\"><label for=\"email\">Demo email</label><input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" value=\"member@example.test\" required autocomplete=\"off\"><label for=\"password\">Demo password</label><input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" value=\"demo-only\" required autocomplete=\"off\"><button id=\"show\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Show password</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"submit\">Try sign-in</button><output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\"></output></form></div><script>const password=document.querySelector('#password'),show=document.querySelector('#show');show.addEventListener('click',()=>{const visible=password.type==='password';password.type=visible?'text':'password';show.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(visible));show.textContent=visible?'Hide password':'Show password'});document.querySelector('#login').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();document.querySelector('#result').textContent=document.querySelector('#email').value==='member@example.test'&&password.value==='demo-only'?'Demo signed in. No account service was contacted.':'Use the displayed synthetic demo credentials.'})</script></body></html>","README.md":"# Quiet sign-in\n\nVersion: 1.0.0\nOriginal getLancer curated recipe. Licence: MIT.\n\n## Setup\nOpen index.html in a modern browser. No packages, installation, API keys or external assets are required. Optional local server: python3 -m http.server 8000.\n\n## Try\nToggle password visibility and try the displayed demo credentials.\n\n## Files\nindex.html contains the working HTML, CSS and JavaScript. LICENSE contains redistribution terms. README.md contains this setup guide.\n\n## Accessibility\nKeyboard controls, visible focus, 44px targets an